~ condition_stabilized
# Reading diary
Danilo: I didn’t realize you were going through all this...
Danilo: [shake]I thought you were happy...[/shake]
Danilo: [wave]I’m sorry, Mateo.[/wave]

# Mateo appears
do ghost_appears.emit("relief")
=> END

~ relief_mateo_appeared
Danilo: Mateo?
Mateo: [wave]Exactly![/wave]
Mateo: You finally found the place I never showed you back then.
Danilo: ... ...
Mateo: Aren’t you happy to see me?
Danilo: I can’t believe I’m actually talking to you.
Mateo: ...
Danilo: I waited for you for so long, and now [wave]I’ve found you[/wave].
do mateo_turn("relief")
=> END

~ relief_mateo_turned
# Mateo turns away
Mateo: ... [wave]Come with me[/wave]
Danilo: Where are we going? Wait for me.
# Mateo walks
do mateo_walk_down("relief")
=> END

~ relief_cliff
# transition outside / cliff
Mateo: Danilo, there’s still so much I wanted to do with you all.
Danilo: ...
Mateo: So much I wanted to do... But thank you, Danilo.
Mateo: [wave]Because you searched for me[/wave], I can finally rest.
do _ghost_left("relief")
# Mateo fading away
do _ghost_vanish("relief")
Danilo: Just a moment, Mateo.
Danilo: There’s so much I still want to tell you.
Danilo: We moved to Manila.
Danilo: I have a job now.
Danilo: Wendy... she’s a psychiatrist.
Danilo: So much happened without you here.
Danilo: Just for a moment, stay here with me.
# Mateo fading away continues, and finishes
Mateo: Thank you for finding me.
Mateo: Live well, Danilo.
do whitey_vanish_full()
=> END

##################################################################
##################################################################
##################################################################

~ condition_worsened
# Reading diary
Danilo: Mateo... oh God... you hid all of this from us...
# Chapel darkens, sound effects
Danilo: I thought... you were happy... that nothing was weighing you down...
Danilo: I never knew... you were hiding all that behind your laughter...
Danilo: But I let you down.
Danilo: Mateo... I’m sorry...
# Ghost appears
do _candle_dim()
do ghost_appears.emit("restless")
=> END

~ resltess_ghost_appeared
Entity: ...Danilo... why... did you leave me...?
Danilo: Mateo... is that you?
do show_distortion()
=> END

~ restless_ghost_turn_and_walk_a_bit
do mateo_turn("restless")
Entity: Come... this way... Danilo... here...
do _candle_dimmer()
do mateo_walk_down("restless")
=> END

~ restless_cliff
# transition outside / cliff
# Shadow stands near edge
Danilo: Mateo...
Entity: ...
# Look down
do _ghost_down("restless")
Entity: ...
Danilo: Just a moment...
Entity: ...
# Look left
do _ghost_left("restless")
Danilo: Don’t leave me yet...
Entity: [fade]...[/fade]
do _ghost_vanish("restless")
Danilo: Nooooooooooooooooo!
# Shadow fades to nothing
# Danilo collapses at the edge. The voices scream louder, swallowing him in darkness.
=> END
